3, the<br>
<br>
=C2=A0 =C2=A0&quot;signature_algorithms&quot; and &quot;signature_algorithm=
s_cert&quot; extension, as<br>
=C2=A0 =C2=A0described in Section 4.2.3 of [TLS13] for TLS 1.3 or the<br>
=C2=A0 =C2=A0&quot;signature_algorithms&quot; extension from Sections 7.4.2=
 and 7.4.6 of<br>
=C2=A0 =C2=A0[RFC5246] for TLS 1.2.<br>
<br>
which makes it clear what applies for TLS but not for DTLS.<br>
